# ABCD - Agent CLI Quick Reference

**This is the primary navigation document for AI agents working with ABCD.**

For detailed information, load the appropriate prompt from `prompts/system/`:
- **WORKSPACE_HIERARCHY_PROMPT.md** - Workspace structure, environments, profiles
- **UBER_AGENT_PROMPT.md** - Creating Uber Agents with sub-actions
- **TESTING_PROMPT.md** - Testing strategies, parallel tests, via-agent tests
- **CURSOR_WDL_WORKFLOW_SYSTEM_PROMPT.md** - WDL operations and workflow creation

---

## Quick Command Reference

### Workflow Development

```bash
# Check status
python cli/status.py my-workflow

# Validate locally
python cli/test_wdl_action.py my-workflow --local-only

# Test remotely
python cli/test_wdl_action.py my-workflow

# Save draft
python cli/save_wdl_draft.py --workflow-id my-workflow

# Publish
python cli/publish_wdl_action.py --workflow-id my-workflow
```

### Workspace Management

```bash
# Environment
python cli/workspace.py env create --id staging --name "Staging" --use
python cli/workspace.py env list

# Agent
python cli/workspace.py agent create --id my-agent --name "My Agent"
python cli/workspace.py agent checkout --remote-id abc123 --env staging --include-subactions

# Action
python cli/workspace.py action create --id my-action --title "My Action"
```

### Testing

```bash
# Single action
python cli/test_wdl_action.py my-action

# Parallel
python cli/test_runner.py action1 action2 action3 --parallel 3

# All in environment
python cli/test_runner.py --workspace production-client-a

# Via-agent (sub-action through agent)
python cli/test_runner.py my-agent --via-agent --subaction get-data
```

### Tool Mode (for sub-actions)

```bash
python cli/deployment_rules.py my-action --enable-tool-mode
python cli/deployment_rules.py my-action --show
```

