## Automatic Behaviors

CLI commands are **transparent by default**:

- **Auto-version**: Detects which version from metadata
- **Auto-draft**: Determines if allow_draft needed
- **Auto-create**: Creates remote action if not linked
- **Auto-recovery**: Searches by title if action_id lost
- **Auto-agent**: Detects agent vs standalone from path

**Only use flags when automatic behavior fails.**

